OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry
OL,6,Fevening to come. Cloud amounts tending
OL,7,Fto increase from the west overnight,
OL,8,Fwith some light rain and drizzle
OL,9,Fpossible as we head towards dawn.
OL,10,FLight winds throughout.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA rather cloudy start, with
OL,13,Fsome light rain and drizzle.
OL,14,FBrightening up for the afternoon, with
OL,15,Fsunny spells and the potential for the
OL,16,Fodd shower.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
